  <DialoguesPerHeatThreshold>k__BackingField:
  - <Tag>k__BackingField: Normal
    <Lines>k__BackingField:
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Hey, I saw that fossil first! Let's settle who gets to keep it with a battle!
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Hey man, whatcha staring at for? I'm just minding my own business but you
        had to come and ruin my vibe.
      - Not getting the memo? Fine then, I'll deal with ya myself.
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Oh yes, of fuck, mmh... Right, almost there...
      - ...
      - Aaah!
      - What are you doing here? I was just... I... Studying....
      - ... You know what, screw you! My lustosaurs are gonna teach you not to sneak
        up on people anymore!
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Don't you find this all odd, you too? The doctor's researches, the lustosaurs
        themselves...
      - Don't get me wrong, I'm not doubting the old man's motivations, but how come
        all fossils we've found here so far are so... Phallic-shaped?
  - <Tag>k__BackingField: Partially Nude
    <Lines>k__BackingField:
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Phew! Starting to get hot down there, heh?
      - I don't blame ya, the mines can be tough for newcomers to the craft.
      - How about a friendly battle to cool off?
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Nice ti- Uhm I mean hi!
      - I think I got lost. This mine is a giant maze.
      - Thankfully my lustosaurs are here to guide me out after a good fuuuu- fight,
        I mean fight, of course, haha...
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Aaah! A monster!
      - Go, my lustosaurs! Attack!
  - <Tag>k__BackingField: Fully Nude
    <Lines>k__BackingField:
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Man...
      - I can't take it anymore...
      - It's so hot down there...
      - I can't even think straight... I think I've put my clothes down somewhere...
        Where are they?
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - D-Don't look at me! It just got super hot in here and... And you're naked
        too, so don't judge!
      - Stop peeping at me like that, you perv!
      - Fine, you asked for it! My lustosaurs are gonna wipe that stupid smug grin
        off of your face!
    - <Lines>k__BackingField:
      - Me? Oh no, I'm not a miner, I'm a nudist.
      - I've heard it could get quite hot down there, so much in fact that most workers
        have to take off their clothes to avoid fainting.
      - I'm pretty used to hot climates. At least I can walk around and pretend I'm
        one of them~
      - 'That''s gonna be our secret, of course~

        Oh, unless you want to
        let our little friends settle this for us? I''ll even let you have your way
        with one of them if you win~'
